// title: M365 Copilot Gone Rouge
// date: 2026-10-23
// product: Defender for Office 365
// tables: UrlClickEvents
// purpose: M365 Copilot Gone Rouge
// source: https://github.com/SlimKQL/Hunting-Queries-Detection-Rules/blob/9c838dc165ac602c525321c6f475e5c90f2fd7d2/DefenderXDR/M365%20Copilot%20Gone%20Rouge.kql
